@deftypefn {} {} try
Begin a try-catch block.

If an error occurs within a @code{try} block, then the code in the @code{catch}
block will be run.  Execution will proceed after the @code{catch} block (though
it is often recommended to use the @code{lasterr} function to re-throw the
error after cleanup is completed).
@xseealso{@ref{XREFcatch,,catch}, @ref{XREFunwind_protect,,unwind_protect}}
@end deftypefn


