@end html


@deftypefn  {} {} catch
@deftypefnx {} {} catch @var{exception_var}
Begin the cleanup part of a try-catch block.

If @var{exception_var} is specified then a variable of that name will defined
in the scope of the @code{catch} block.  The variable is a scalar struct with
fields @code{identifier}, @code{message}, and @code{stack} which describes
the error that was caught.
@xseealso{@ref{XREFtry,,try}}
@end deftypefn


