@deftypefn {} {} unwind_protect
Begin an unwind_protect block.

If an error occurs within the first part of an @code{unwind_protect} block the
commands within the @code{unwind_protect_cleanup} block are executed before the
error is thrown.  If an error is not thrown, then the
@code{unwind_protect_cleanup} block is still executed.  In other words, the
@code{unwind_protect_cleanup} code is guaranteed to execute regardless of
success or failure in the @code{unwind_protect} block.
@xseealso{@ref{XREFunwind_protect_cleanup,,unwind_protect_cleanup}, @ref{XREFtry,,try}}
@end deftypefn


